{"units":[{"id":"u1","kind":"example","title":"Highly Rated badge product-page experiment","claim":{"text":"The source describes an Optimizely retail experiment that used Highly Rated badges on product pages to drive add-to-cart activity.","quote":"Using "Highly Rated" badges to drive add-to-cart on product pages"},"action":null,"trigger":{"op":"all","args":[]},"prerequisites":{"op":"all","args":[]},"exclusions":{"op":"any","args":[]},"completion":[],"unknowns":["The excerpt does not state the experiment design, audience, badge placement, sample size, or measured lift for the badge variation."],"relations":[]},{"id":"u2","kind":"example","title":"Size-filter friction-reduction experiment","claim":{"text":"The source describes a retail experiment using size filters to reduce friction and reports that the experiments increased attention to popular products and the likelihood of adding those items to the cart.","quote":"using size filters to reduce friction. Both experiments drew more attention to popular products and increased the likelihood that those items would be added to the cart."},"action":null,"trigger":{"op":"all","args":[]},"prerequisites":{"op":"all","args":[]},"exclusions":{"op":"any","args":[]},"completion":[],"unknowns":["The excerpt does not specify the filter design, product category, audience, measurement method, or result attributable specifically to size filters."],"relations":[]},{"id":"u3","kind":"unresolved_claim","title":"Kutts conversion and revenue result has an unspecified variation","claim":{"text":"The source reports that an unspecified Kutts variation improved ecommerce conversion rate by nearly 6% and revenue by 9%.","quote":"A variation improved the ecommerce conversion rate by nearly **6% and revenue by 9%**."},"action":null,"trigger":{"op":"all","args":[]},"prerequisites":{"op":"all","args":[]},"exclusions":{"op":"any","args":[]},"completion":[],"unknowns":["The variation is not described.","The excerpt does not state whether the reported conversion and revenue changes are relative or absolute, their denominator, sample size, test duration, or statistical confidence."],"relations":[]},{"id":"u4","kind":"action","title":"Disclose shipping, taxes, and fees before checkout","claim":{"text":"The source identifies late extra costs as the largest stated checkout-abandonment lever and says early cost disclosure can reduce abandonment.","quote":"Pricing transparency is the single largest lever. Thirty-nine percent of shoppers abandon checkout when extra costs such as shipping, taxes, or fees appear late in the process. Early cost disclosure is a direct lever for reducing abandonment."},"action":{"text":"Show shipping, taxes, and fees before checkout begins.","quote":"**Be transparent about fees** — show shipping, taxes, and fees before checkout begins"},"trigger":{"op":"all","args":[{"text":"The source reports that 39% of shoppers abandon checkout when shipping, taxes, or fees appear late.","quote":"Thirty-nine percent of shoppers abandon checkout when extra costs such as shipping, taxes, or fees appear late in the process."}]},"prerequisites":{"op":"all","args":[]},"exclusions":{"op":"any","args":[]},"completion":[],"unknowns":["The excerpt does not specify which cost-estimation method to use when shipping or tax varies by destination."],"relations":[]},{"id":"u5","kind":"action","title":"Make guest checkout prominent for first-time buyers","claim":{"text":"The source characterizes guest checkout as a highly impactful intervention and says forced account creation adds friction before purchase.","quote":"Guest checkout is one of the single most impactful CRO interventions available. Forcing first-time buyers to create an account—choose a username, set a password, verify email—before they can buy introduces friction at the worst possible moment."},"action":{"text":"Make guest checkout prominent rather than forcing first-time buyers to create an account before purchase.","quote":"Baymard finds that **62% of sites don't make guest checkout prominent enough**."},"trigger":{"op":"all","args":[{"text":"The source reports that 62% of sites do not make guest checkout prominent enough.","quote":"62% of sites don't make guest checkout prominent enough"}]},"prerequisites":{"op":"all","args":[]},"exclusions":{"op":"any","args":[]},"completion":[],"unknowns":["The excerpt does not define how prominence should be measured or specify the guest-checkout UI treatment."],"relations":[]},{"id":"u6","kind":"action","title":"Reduce checkout-form effort","claim":{"text":"The source says each additional checkout field creates another opportunity for abandonment.","quote":"Every additional field in the checkout form is an additional opportunity for abandonment."},"action":{"text":"Keep only checkout fields strictly necessary for the transaction, use autofill capabilities, and provide progress indicators.","quote":"The optimal checkout form contains only fields strictly necessary to complete the transaction. Autofill capabilities dramatically reduce effort and improve completion rates. Progress indicators reduce the anxiety of the unknown."},"trigger":{"op":"all","args":[{"text":"The source identifies additional checkout fields as opportunities for abandonment.","quote":"Every additional field in the checkout form is an additional opportunity for abandonment."}]},"prerequisites":{"op":"all","args":[]},"exclusions":{"op":"any","args":[]},"completion":[],"unknowns":["The excerpt does not define which fields are strictly necessary for a given business, payment method, or jurisdiction."],"relations":[]},{"id":"u7","kind":"action","title":"Use high-contrast checkout buttons","claim":{"text":"The source reports that high-contrast buttons and fewer fields substantially enhance conversion rates according to a machine-learning analysis of checkout sessions.","quote":"High-contrast buttons and minimal field numbers substantially enhance conversion rates, according to machine learning analysis of checkout sessions."},"action":{"text":"Use high-contrast buttons in checkout.","quote":"High-contrast buttons and minimal field numbers substantially enhance conversion rates"},"trigger":{"op":"all","args":[]},"prerequisites":{"op":"all","args":[]},"exclusions":{"op":"any","args":[]},"completion":[],"unknowns":["The excerpt does not define the required contrast level, button placement, or outcome measurement.","The reported 87% Logistic Regression accuracy does not establish a causal implementation effect."],"relations":[]},{"id":"u8","kind":"action","title":"Offer payment methods used by the target audience","claim":{"text":"The source says that offering payment methods commonly used by the target audience is critical and gives market-specific wallet examples.","quote":"Offering all payment methods commonly used by the target audience is critical. In markets like India, UPI has become dominant; in Western markets, Apple Pay, Google Pay, and Shop Pay accelerate checkout."},"action":{"text":"Offer the payment methods commonly used by the target audience, recognize payment brands and digital wallets, and avoid unnecessary payment redirects or context switches.","quote":"Recognize payment brands and digital wallets. Avoid unnecessary redirects or context switches during payment."},"trigger":{"op":"all","args":[]},"prerequisites":{"op":"all","args":[]},"exclusions":{"op":"any","args":[]},"completion":[],"unknowns":["The excerpt does not identify the target audience's market, payment preferences, or feasible payment-provider integrations."],"relations":[]},{"id":"u9","kind":"action","title":"Surface checkout security and policy signals","claim":{"text":"The source recommends visible security indicators, return policies, recognizable payment brands, and smart authentication to build trust and reduce friction.","quote":"Clearly surface security indicators, return policies, and recognizable payment brands. Build trust with security signals. Reduce friction with smart authentication."},"action":{"text":"Clearly surface security indicators, return policies, and recognizable payment brands, and reduce friction with smart authentication.","quote":"Clearly surface security indicators, return policies, and recognizable payment brands. Build trust with security signals. Reduce friction with smart authentication."},"trigger":{"op":"all","args":[{"text":"The source lists payment security concerns as a persistent checkout-abandonment reason.","quote":"| Payment security concerns | Persistent |"}]},"prerequisites":{"op":"all","args":[]},"exclusions":{"op":"any","args":[]},"completion":[],"unknowns":["The excerpt does not specify which security indicators, policy details, or authentication approach are appropriate."],"relations":[]},{"id":"u10","kind":"action","title":"Make mobile checkout controls touch-friendly","claim":{"text":"The source directs stores to ensure that mobile checkout elements are large enough and appropriately spaced.","quote":"Ensure mobile checkout elements are large enough and spaced appropriately."},"action":{"text":"Make mobile checkout elements large enough and appropriately spaced, and optimize mobile checkout with one-page or wallet-based flows.","quote":"Ensure mobile checkout elements are large enough and spaced appropriately. Optimize relentlessly for mobile checkout with one-page or wallet-based flows (Apple Pay, Shop Pay)."},"trigger":{"op":"all","args":[{"text":"The source reports that mobile abandonment is approximately 85%.","quote":"Mobile abandonment is approximately **85%**"}]},"prerequisites":{"op":"all","args":[]},"exclusions":{"op":"any","args":[]},"completion":[],"unknowns":["The excerpt provides no tap-target dimensions, spacing thresholds, or criteria for choosing one-page versus wallet-based flows."],"relations":[]},{"id":"u11","kind":"action","title":"Display brand reviews on the checkout page","claim":{"text":"The source lists displaying brand reviews on the checkout page as a cart-abandonment recovery tactic because it reinforces trust at the point of highest hesitation.","quote":"**Display brand reviews on checkout page** — reinforces trust at the point of highest hesitation"},"action":{"text":"Display brand reviews on the checkout page.","quote":"**Display brand reviews on checkout page**"},"trigger":{"op":"all","args":[{"text":"The source states that cart abandonment averages 70.22%.","quote":"Cart abandonment averages **70.22%**."}]},"prerequisites":{"op":"all","args":[]},"exclusions":{"op":"any","args":[]},"completion":[],"unknowns":["The excerpt does not specify which reviews to display, their placement, or how review authenticity should be established."],"relations":[]},{"id":"u12","kind":"action","title":"Capture shoppers with exit-intent pop-ups","claim":{"text":"The source lists exit-intent pop-ups as a way to capture abandoners before they leave.","quote":"**Exit-intent pop-ups** — capture abandoners before they leave"},"action":{"text":"Use exit-intent pop-ups to capture abandoners before they leave.","quote":"**Exit-intent pop-ups** — capture abandoners before they leave"},"trigger":{"op":"all","args":[{"text":"The source identifies the cart stage between add-to-cart and checkout initiation as a major revenue-leak point.","quote":"The cart stage—between adding to cart and initiating checkout—is where a massive share of revenue leaks."}]},"prerequisites":{"op":"all","args":[]},"exclusions":{"op":"any","args":[]},"completion":[],"unknowns":["The excerpt does not define exit-intent detection, the pop-up message, eligibility, or mobile behavior."],"relations":[]},{"id":"u13","kind":"action","title":"Re-engage cart abandoners within an hour and escalate over 72 hours","claim":{"text":"The source recommends that recovery campaigns re-engage abandoners within the first hour and escalate with objection handling and urgency over 72 hours.","quote":"Recovery campaigns should re-engage abandoners within the first hour and escalate through objection handling and urgency over 72 hours."},"action":{"text":"Run automatic reminder-message sequences via email and SMS, re-engaging abandoners within the first hour and escalating through objection handling and urgency over 72 hours.","quote":"**Automatic reminder messages** — timed sequences via email and SMS

- **Multi-step message flows** — objection handling and urgency over 72 hours

- **Incentives**"},"trigger":{"op":"all","args":[{"text":"The source states that cart abandonment averages 70.22%.","quote":"Cart abandonment averages **70.22%**."}]},"prerequisites":{"op":"all","args":[]},"exclusions":{"op":"any","args":[]},"completion":[],"unknowns":["The excerpt does not specify message count, timing after the first hour, consent requirements, channel eligibility, or the objection-handling content."],"relations":[]},{"id":"u14","kind":"action","title":"Offer time-limited recovery incentives","claim":{"text":"The source lists time-limited discounts or free-shipping offers as cart-abandonment incentives.","quote":"**Incentives** — time-limited discounts or free shipping offers"},"action":{"text":"Use time-limited discounts or free-shipping offers as recovery incentives.","quote":"**Incentives** — time-limited discounts or free shipping offers"},"trigger":{"op":"all","args":[{"text":"The source presents incentives as a cart-abandonment recovery tactic.","quote":"**Recovery tactics:**"}]},"prerequisites":{"op":"all","args":[]},"exclusions":{"op":"any","args":[]},"completion":[],"unknowns":["The excerpt does not state discount levels, qualification rules, timing, margin constraints, or whether incentives should be tested against non-incentive recovery."],"relations":[]},{"id":"u15","kind":"action","title":"Personalize cart reassurance from real-time intent","claim":{"text":"The source recommends real-time intent detection to present reassurance about fit, shipping, returns, or compatibility before a shopper bounces.","quote":"**Personalization** — real-time intent detection to show the right reassurance (fit, shipping, returns, compatibility) before a shopper bounces"},"action":{"text":"Use real-time intent detection to show reassurance about fit, shipping, returns, or compatibility before a shopper bounces.","quote":"real-time intent detection to show the right reassurance (fit, shipping, returns, compatibility) before a shopper bounces"},"trigger":{"op":"all","args":[{"text":"The source identifies the cart stage as a point where a massive share of revenue leaks.","quote":"The cart stage—between adding to cart and initiating checkout—is where a massive share of revenue leaks."}]},"prerequisites":{"op":"all","args":[]},"exclusions":{"op":"any","args":[]},"completion":[],"unknowns":["The excerpt does not define the real-time intent signals, matching logic, data-consent requirements, or how to select the appropriate reassurance."],"relations":[]},{"id":"u16","kind":"action","title":"Meet the source's mobile speed targets","claim":{"text":"The source calls for mobile LCP under two seconds and specifies image-compression, preconnect, and JavaScript-deferral practices.","quote":"**Mobile-specific speed targets:** Target under 2s LCP. Compress images sharply (<100KB hero, <60KB grid). Preconnect key domains. Defer non-critical JavaScript."},"action":{"text":"Target under-2-second mobile LCP; compress hero images below 100KB and grid images below 60KB; preconnect key domains; and defer non-critical JavaScript.","quote":"Target under 2s LCP. Compress images sharply (<100KB hero, <60KB grid). Preconnect key domains. Defer non-critical JavaScript."},"trigger":{"op":"all","args":[{"text":"The source reports that every 100ms slower LCP corresponds to 3.5% lower conversion.","quote":"Every 100ms slower → **3.5% lower conversion**"}]},"prerequisites":{"op":"all","args":[]},"exclusions":{"op":"any","args":[]},"completion":[{"text":"Mobile LCP is under two seconds.","quote":"Target under 2s LCP."}],"unknowns":["The excerpt does not specify the LCP measurement environment, device mix, page template, or which domains and scripts are critical."],"relations":[]}],"more_units":true,"unresolved":["Omitted because of the 16-unit cap: checkout benchmark and usability-statistic claims, generic checkout-process optimization, and the source's mediocre-checkout warning.","Omitted because of the cap: broader trust-signal recommendations, including customer reviews and ratings, realistic review distributions, security badges and payment logos, social-proof indicators, return and warranty details, transparent shipping information, and inline placement of trust indicators.","Omitted because of the cap: mobile-CRO recommendations on thumb-zone placement, swipeable cards, avoiding squeezed desktop grids, avoiding hamburger-hidden filters, tap-friendly CTAs, clickable phone/email fields, floating key CTAs, and contextual social proof.","Omitted because of the cap: broader personalization recommendations, including personalized homepage and bestseller recommendations and selectively layering personalization after trust signals and well-designed pages.","The excerpt begins an LLM-referral comparison but provides no extraction-ready recommendation for acting on LLM-driven traffic; any continuation beyond the displayed comparison is unavailable."]}
